    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 8.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ofer ðis fals wyrce þolie ðara handa ðe he þæt fals mid worhte, ⁊ he hí mid nanum ðingum ne bycge, ne mid golde ne mid seolfre.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who henceforth coins false money shall forfeit the hand with which he made the false money, and he shall not redeem it in any way, either with gold or with silver.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ofer fals wyrce, þolige þæra handa, þe he þæt fals mid worhte; ⁊ he hi mid nanon þingon ne gebicge, ne mid golde ne mid seolfre.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
